Thanks for feedback.  

Could you elaborate the errors you mentioned above?

The error of aplay in alsa-lib-1.0.10rc1 might be the lack of "audio"
group on your system.  The default configuration assumes the "audio"
group.
The fix is either to create this group, or to edit
/usr/share/alsa/pcm/dmix.conf and remove (or uncomment) the line with
"ipc_group".


